message: 'To cite package "moodleLA" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'moodleLA: Helper functions to facilitate learning analytics with Moodle data'
version: 0.0.0.9002
abstract: A package for R that provides access to Moodle data for learning analytics,
  including the pseudonymization of personally identifiable information (PII). 'Moodle'
  is an open source Learning Management System (LMS) developed by MoodleHQ. For more
  information about Moodle, visit <https://moodle.org>.
